{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023551_91534584","chunk_index":19,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023551_91534584","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","quote":"章节编号=12.1\n章节标题=研究方案的依从","quote_sha256":"7a701c833fc23be3666f8de851226122f1436afbf1a0b43252a750161a029826","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","span_id":"span_sel_12_1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f99734c87881f7d6c64a1421824e8d63df9b86db797b44cc550ce00fc96423c7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_treatment"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_periods"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","quote":"根据 GCP 要求，未经申办者和 EC 的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床 试验管理方面的改动。","quote_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","span_id":"span_corpus_deviation"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究 方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。","quote_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"span_corpus_training"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_corpus_ethics"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_12_1","span_cur_adherence","span_cur_treatment","span_cur_periods","span_corpus_deviation","span_corpus_training","span_corpus_ethics"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"研究方案的依从","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节阐述研究实施中对研究方案依从性的管理要求。研究团队应在研究启动前及研究过程中接受方案相关培训，确保各参研人员充分理解并按照经伦理委员会批准的方案及其修订版本执行。受试者应在双盲治疗期内接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服或匹配安慰剂，连续16周；研究期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。药品计数记录和受试者日记应真实、完整、可溯源，作为依从性评价的依据；对依从性异常的情况应进行记录和评估。对于方案要求的访视、评估和操作，应按经批准的方案执行；任何可能影响受试者安全或数据完整性的偏离均应按照方案偏离管理要求记录、评估和报告。未经申办者和伦理委员会同意，研究者不得修改或偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床试验管理方面的改动。研究实施应严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他适用法律法规。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持本章写入16周双盲治疗期、试验组100 mg每日一次口服合成试验药A或匹配安慰剂，以及通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性；GCP对方案修改和偏离的限制及启动前培训要求支持依从性管理原则。医学作者需核对依从性判定阈值、异常依从处理及与方案偏离章节的衔接。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023551_91534584","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","quote":"章节编号=12.2\n章节标题=监查","quote_sha256":"f48aab63aa9268a048ccb5d255b8ed41e1843cbe3b16382e0b953d967303e1cc","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","span_id":"span_sel_12_2"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"span_corpus_signature"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_multicenter"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"3ec59e547073179cb46993e78df3772422b67af8daa6a8853d4cbf44823e1b37","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_cur_visits"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究 方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。","quote_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"span_corpus_training"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_corpus_ethics"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_12_2","span_corpus_signature","span_cur_multicenter","span_cur_design","span_cur_periods","span_cur_visits","span_corpus_training","span_corpus_ethics"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节说明本研究的监查安排。申办者负责组织监查，研究者同意接受申办者派遣的临床监查员对本次临床研究进行监查，以确认受试者的权益、安全和健康受到保护，并确认研究数据真实、准确、完整，研究实施符合经伦理委员会批准的方案、GCP及适用法律法规。监查范围应涵盖受试者权益保护、研究数据质量、方案依从性、试验用药品管理以及安全性报告等与本研究实施相关的内容。对于本项多中心、双盲、安慰剂对照研究，监查活动应覆盖筛选期、第1天至第16周双盲治疗期以及第20周安全性随访期所产生的数据。临床监查员与研究者应就监查中发现的问题进行沟通，研究者应配合提供所需资料并采取适当的纠正和预防措施。监查活动应按照适用的GCP和法规要求保留记录。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持本章写入多中心、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机设计，16周双盲治疗期，第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视及第20周安全性随访；研究者签署页同意接受申办者派遣的临床监查员监查，GCP和ICH-GCP要求支持监查范围与记录。医学作者需核对监查方式、频次、记录和报告要求是否需引用项目监查计划。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023551_91534584","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"研究者同意接受申办者派遣的稽查员稽查及药品监督管理部门视查的GCP要求，以及方案信息保密和披露限制支持本章；研究实施遵循《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP和ICH-GCP E6（R3）等要求。医学作者需核对稽查与核查的配合、整改和文件保存安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023551_91534584","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"方案偏离","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"GCP关于未经申办者和伦理委员会同意不得修改或偏离方案、紧急危害例外及管理性改动的表述支持本章；研究启动前培训要求支持减少方案偏离。医学作者需核对偏离分级、报告路径、时限和纠正预防措施是否需项目层面明确。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc","section_number":"12.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:053ede25f4578565d8ab8e7e","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"6b801a21cf7c158eeaec249bf45ccd3e21fb5e609cdbac4783c92230d3db3674"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"}]}